{%- comment -%}
  Product page (Figma "product pg 1") — portrait image column left, info panel
  right. Every element is a reorderable, hideable block: breadcrumb, title,
  variant picker, description, accordions, media and add to cart. Each piece's
  markup lives once in snippets/pdp-block so nothing drifts.

  TWO COLUMNS, ONE BLOCK LIST: the media block always renders into the left
  column and the gallery into its own grid row, whatever position it holds in
  the list; the rest flow down the info column in block order. Dragging media
  around the list therefore reorders nothing — the layout is a grid, not a
  stack.

  LEGACY FALLBACK: a saved template from before this refactor holds only
  accordion blocks. Rendering it literally would leave a page with nothing but
  two accordions on it, and Shopify validates a template's JSON against the
  schema it had BEFORE the push, so the new block list cannot land in the same
  commit as this file. Until it does, a template with no structural block
  renders the full default order. It costs nothing once the blocks are saved.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign product_images = product.media | where: 'media_type', 'image'

  assign has_structure = false
  assign media_block = null
  for b in section.blocks
    unless b.type == 'accordion'
      assign has_structure = true
    endunless
    if b.type == 'media'
      assign media_block = b
    endif
  endfor

  assign show_media = true
  if has_structure and media_block == null
    assign show_media = false
  endif

  assign media_ratio = media_block.settings.media_ratio | default: section.settings.media_ratio | default: '4/5'
  assign gallery_gap = media_block.settings.gallery_gap | default: 24

  comment
    The media column's real width, expressed rather than guessed. A single vw
    figure cannot be right across the range: the left gutter is
    clamp(220px, 18.7vw, 300px), so below 1604px it scales with the viewport
    and above it is a fixed 300px — the column is 38vw of a 1440 screen but
    41vw of a 1920 one. A flat "40vw" therefore UNDER-states it on large
    screens, and understating `sizes` is what makes the browser pick too small
    a candidate, i.e. the blur this is meant to prevent. Over-stating only
    costs bytes, so both branches keep ~2% of headroom.

      >= 1604px : (100vw - 300 - 40 - 84) * 581/1108
      >=  750px : (100vw - 18.7vw - 40 - 5.3vw) * 581/1108
      <   750px : one column, 40px page margin each side
  endcomment
  assign pdp_media_sizes = '(min-width: 1604px) calc(53vw - 220px), (min-width: 750px) calc(41vw - 20px), calc(100vw - 80px)'
-%}

<section class="main-product" style="--media-ratio: {{ media_ratio }}; --pdp-gallery-gap: {{ gallery_gap }}px;">
  <div class="main-product__grid">
    {%- if show_media -%}
      <div class="main-product__media" {{ media_block.shopify_attributes }}>
        {%- if product_images.size > 0 -%}
          <div class="main-product__media-item main-product__media-item--hero">
            {{-
              product_images.first
              | image_url: width: 2400
              | image_tag:
                widths: '550, 750, 1100, 1500, 2000, 2400',
                sizes: pdp_media_sizes,
                loading: 'eager',
                fetchpriority: 'high'
            -}}
          </div>
        {%- else -%}
          <div class="main-product__media-item main-product__media-item--empty" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <div class="main-product__info">
      {%- if has_structure -%}
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          {%- unless block.type == 'media' -%}
            {% render 'pdp-block', type: block.type, block: block, product: product, section: section %}
          {%- endunless -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- else -%}
        {% render 'pdp-block', type: 'breadcrumb', product: product, section: section %}
        {% render 'pdp-block', type: 'title', product: product, section: section %}
        {% render 'pdp-block', type: 'variant_picker', product: product, section: section %}
        {% render 'pdp-block', type: 'description', product: product, section: section %}
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          {% render 'pdp-block', type: 'accordion', block: block, product: product, section: section %}
        {%- endfor -%}
        {% render 'pdp-block', type: 'add_to_cart', product: product, section: section %}
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- comment -%}
      Gallery: every image after the hero, full column width, height from the
      image's own aspect ratio. Nothing is ever cropped — editorial rule. It is
      a grid child rather than a child of the media column so the single column
      on mobile can put it AFTER the info panel: otherwise the title, price and
      add-to-cart sit below three full-bleed photos. On desktop it lands back
      under the hero in the left column. A single-image product renders no
      gallery at all (no empty state, no placeholder).
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if show_media and product_images.size > 1 -%}
      <div class="pdp-gallery">
        {%- for media in product_images offset: 1 -%}
          <div class="pdp-gallery__item">
            {{-
              media
              | image_url: width: 2400
              | image_tag:
                widths: '550, 750, 1100, 1500, 2000, 2400',
                sizes: pdp_media_sizes,
                loading: 'lazy'
            -}}
          </div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Product page",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_vendor",
      "label": "Show vendor",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "media_ratio",
      "label": "Image aspect ratio",
      "options": [
        { "value": "3/4", "label": "Portrait 3:4" },
        { "value": "4/5", "label": "Portrait 4:5" },
        { "value": "1/1", "label": "Square" }
      ],
      "default": "4/5",
      "info": "Applies to the hero image only — gallery images are never cropped"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    { "type": "breadcrumb", "name": "Breadcrumb", "limit": 1 },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "name": "Title",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "title_font",
          "label": "Typeface",
          "options": [
            { "value": "heading", "label": "Primary" },
            { "value": "body", "label": "Secondary" }
          ],
          "default": "heading"
        },
        {
          "type": "color",
          "id": "title_color",
          "label": "Colour",
          "info": "Empty uses the theme's"
        },
        {
          "type": "range",
          "id": "spacing_bottom",
          "label": "Space below",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 80,
          "step": 2,
          "unit": "px",
          "default": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "checkbox",
          "id": "show_subtitle",
          "label": "Show subtitle",
          "default": true
        },
        {
          "type": "checkbox",
          "id": "show_vendor",
          "label": "Show vendor",
          "default": true,
          "info": "Also needs the section's vendor setting on"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "variant_picker",
      "name": "Variant picker",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "range",
          "id": "spacing_top",
          "label": "Space above the swatches",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 80,
          "step": 2,
          "unit": "px",
          "default": 26,
          "info": "Between the title and the colour swatches on this page. The one in Theme settings → Product cards is a different place: the grid card."
        },
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "option_style",
          "label": "Size and other options",
          "options": [
            { "value": "buttons", "label": "Buttons" },
            { "value": "dropdown", "label": "Dropdown" }
          ],
          "default": "buttons",
          "info": "Colour always uses swatches"
        }
      ]
    },
    { "type": "description", "name": "Description", "limit": 1 },
    {
      "type": "media",
      "name": "Media",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "media_ratio",
          "label": "Hero image ratio",
          "options": [
            { "value": "3/4", "label": "Portrait 3:4" },
            { "value": "4/5", "label": "Portrait 4:5" },
            { "value": "1/1", "label": "Square" }
          ],
          "default": "3/4",
          "info": "The hero only. Gallery images below it are never cropped."
        },
        {
          "type": "range",
          "id": "gallery_gap",
          "label": "Space between gallery images",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 64,
          "step": 4,
          "unit": "px",
          "default": 24,
          "info": "The air between the stacked photographs, and between the hero and the first of them"
        }
      ]
    },
    { "type": "add_to_cart", "name": "Add to cart", "limit": 1 },
    {
      "type": "product_details",
      "name": "Product details",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "title",
          "label": "Heading",
          "default": "Product Details"
        },
        {
          "type": "richtext",
          "id": "content",
          "label": "Details",
          "info": "Material, dimensions… Connect a product metafield (dynamic source) so each product shows its own lines."
        },
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "heading_font",
          "label": "Heading typeface",
          "options": [
            { "value": "body", "label": "Secondary" },
            { "value": "heading", "label": "Primary" }
          ],
          "default": "body"
        },
        {
          "type": "color",
          "id": "text_color",
          "label": "Text colour",
          "info": "Empty uses the theme's"
        },
        {
          "type": "range",
          "id": "spacing_top",
          "label": "Space above",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 120,
          "step": 4,
          "unit": "px",
          "default": 56
        },
        {
          "type": "checkbox",
          "id": "show_color",
          "label": "Show the selected colour",
          "default": true,
          "info": "Follows the variant the shopper picks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "accordion",
      "name": "Accordion",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "title",
          "label": "Title",
          "default": "Shipping & returns"
        },
        {
          "type": "richtext",
          "id": "content",
          "label": "Content",
          "default": "<p>Share your shipping and returns policy here.</p>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "max_blocks": 16,
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Product page",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "media" },
        { "type": "breadcrumb" },
        { "type": "title" },
        { "type": "variant_picker" },
        { "type": "description" },
        { "type": "accordion" },
        { "type": "add_to_cart" },
        { "type": "product_details" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
